You have a hopeful feeling means that your prayer-timeout wasn't over
yet. The first time (when offering) that your prayer timeout is over,
you will get the message "You have a feeling of reconciliation". If
this takes a long while, you must have done something terribly wront,
to have such a long prayer-timeout. Each time you offer, though, your
prayer time-out will become smaller.

